  {
    "episode_id": 43479,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/3/43479.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 24,
    "turn_text": "Well, I'll be honest, if my criticism of Mr. Zimmern's campaign, and he and I go back about 30 years, is that when he got that research book from Detroit, he should have invested in his own OPPO research project. I don't know about Paul Hodes, but I can tell you, Not only did I do a full Oppo book on every opponent I had, whether it was going to be a tight race or a",
